500	    /**
501	     * Reports whether an unusually high number of owners have been created for today's business
502	     * day, i.e. whether more than {@link #BULK_SIGNUP_WARNING_THRESHOLD} owners already fall on
503	     * the business day that {@code LocalDate.now()} rolls forward to.
504	     *
